{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19020","headline":"酬令狐相公庭前白菊花谢偶书所怀见寄 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公庭前白菊花谢偶书所怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数丛如雪色，一旦冒霜开。\n寒蘂差池落，清香断续来。\n思深含别怨，芳谢惜年催。\n千里难同赏，看看又早梅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}